      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je viens d’avoir une super idée pour un nouveau\nbusiness... Ça va cartonner, tu vas voir !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé hé hé... Tu savais qu’on pouvait rejoindre\nles égouts depuis ce passage ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça m’a donné une super idée de business...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006D2019006100200064006F006E006E00E900200075006E006500200073007500700065007200200069006400E9006500200064006500200062007500730069006E006500730073002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec Camérupt, on va se faire des millions,\nc’est sûr !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007600650063002000430061006D00E90072007500700074002C0020006F006E00200076006100200073006500200066006100690072006500200064006500730020006D0069006C006C0069006F006E0073002C000A006320190065007300740020007300FB007200200021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rupt !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052007500700074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux bien nous aider ? Il y a une récompense\nà la clé si tu acceptes, promis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On t’attendra à l’intérieur. La porte t’est ouverte,\nsi t’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à découvrir ce qu’on te prépare...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé hé hé... Je t’attendais.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E90020006800E90020006800E9002E002E002E0020004A00650020007420190061007400740065006E0064006100690073002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors ? Pas mal, cet espace, hein ? Il y fait\nbien sombre et humide comme on aime !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si t’es là, c’est que t’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à découvrir\nce qu’on t’a préparé... Alors, en garde !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Camérupt et moi, on est chaud bouillants\npour un combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006D00E900720075007000740020006500740020006D006F0069002C0020006F006E002000650073007400200063006800610075006400200062006F00750069006C006C0061006E00740073000A0070006F0075007200200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400200021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viens nous voir quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à te battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E00730020006E006F0075007300200076006F006900720020007100750061006E006400200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E0002000740065002000620061007400740072006500200021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Camérupt et moi, on est chaud bouillants\npour un combat ! Qu’est-ce que t’en dis ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais vous cramer tous les deux !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007600610069007300200076006F007500730020006300720061006D0065007200200074006F007500730020006C0065007300200064006500750078002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne préfère pas.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E006500200070007200E9006600E8007200650020007000610073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, quoi ! Sois pas si froid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C002000710075006F00690020002100200053006F006900730020007000610073002000730069002000660072006F0069006400100003110000FF0100006500200021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est ce qu’on voulait entendre !\nAllez, c’est parti ! Ça va être le feu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est parfait ! Notre combat a bien fait grimper\nla température... Exactement comme prévu !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMaintenant, on peut enfin ouvrir...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... le Sauna Camérupt !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020006C00650020005300610075006E0061002000430061006D00E900720075007000740020002100210021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec le magma à 10 000 degrés que renferment\nles bosses de Camérupt, c’est tout à fait possible !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La chaleur générée peut être redirigée dans\nce lieu pour en faire une étuve parfaite !!!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nC’est l’idée du siècle, je te le dis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ici ? Vraiment ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300690020003F00200056007200610069006D0065006E00740020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans les égouts ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006E00730020006C00650073002000E90067006F0075007400730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as pas l’air emballé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005420190061007300200070006100730020006C201900610069007200200065006D00620061006C006C00E900100003110000FF01000065002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cet espace est parfait pour créer un sauna,\nmais c’est vrai qu’il est pas très bien situé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Baaa !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100610061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ?\nOh, c’est juste un Pokémon sauvage...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F000A004F0068002C0020006320190065007300740020006A007500730074006500200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200073006100750076006100670065002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Raaa !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006100610061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, c’est marrant, ils ont l’air d’être bien,\nposés ici...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400690065006E0073002C0020006320190065007300740020006D0061007200720061006E0074002C00200069006C00730020006F006E00740020006C201900610069007200200064201900EA0074007200650020006200690065006E002C000A0070006F007300E900730020006900630069002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends... ils seraient pas en train de kiffer\nnotre sauna, là ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640073002E002E002E00200069006C00730020007300650072006100690065006E0074002000700061007300200065006E00200074007200610069006E0020006400650020006B00690066006600650072000A006E006F0074007200650020007300610075006E0061002C0020006C00E00020003F0021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ben voilà ! Je l’ai trouvée, ma clientèle !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420065006E00200076006F0069006C00E0002000210020004A00650020006C201900610069002000740072006F0075007600E90065002C0020006D006100200063006C00690065006E007400E8006C006500200021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
